  "instructions": [
    "Heat goose fat in a skillet over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add diced tomatoes and cook until soft, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in roasted chickpeas and red pepper flakes, cooking for another 2 minutes.",
    "In a bowl, combine cooked quinoa, tomato mixture, and pickled cucumber slices.",
    "Drizzle olive oil, squeeze lemon juice, and sprinkle oregano over the mixture.",
    "Gently crumble feta cheese on top and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the assembled bowl to a lacquerware bowl for serving.",
    "Let the bowl rest for 2 minutes to allow the feta to melt slightly, then enjoy."
